<title>USA: Weeks Corp files shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Weeks Corp files shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weeks Corp said Friday that filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $300 million of common stock, preferred stock and common stock warrants.</p>
<p>The company plans to use the proceeds from any offering of such securities for corporate purposes which may include the repayment of indebtedness, the financing of future development and the funding of future acquisitions.</p>
</text>
